      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m wondering if picture should be extracted from the sink/generator paradigm. It seems like the generator/sink are special cases that are only designed to work together while the other sink/generators can be paired in any combination.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 76,
        "startChar": 17,
