      "writtenOn": "2022-06-22T15:56:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good point.  I\u0027d rather not duplicate the frame loop though, so maybe a compromise is to keep it as a sinkless generator -- that way it can be driven like all other generators but the Sink abstraction no longer needs to know about SkPictures.\n\nLet me know what you think.",
